          <rdf:li>Perfuma (She-Ra)</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Moral Dilemmas</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Revenge</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Does Finn Kill Catra? I Don't Want to Know</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Double Trouble is a Jerk</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Double Trouble Loves Drama</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Consequences</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Guilt</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Survivor Guilt</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Also guilt because you killed your adopted child's biological parents when you were a teenager</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Fluff and Angst</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Emotional Hurt/Comfort</rdf:li>
